    {
      "title": "How it works",
      "facts": [
        {
          "text": "Copying snapshots to other regions adds cross-region data-transfer charges and additional snapshot-storage charges in those regions. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/cluster-configuration-costs.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/billing/cluster-configuration-costs.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:3f058c3bf6da1135573c5838cc25759f269b83a0aa5a2524e8c79c5b9123f9cd",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
          "evidenceIds": [],
          "also": [
            "https://www.pointfive.co/efficiency-hub/inefficiencies/excessive-snapshot-retention-and-cross-region-copies-in-mongodb-atlas-cloud-backup"
          ],
          "originValidationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "originEvidenceIds": [
            "ev:c854ea1b580ea48c384f9c49ac0bb3f17915a6f112cad749ac7a758984d7d9a8",
            "ev:d676fe9d6059636754c6bf6f502f0d6d73283a2bd6adb943253f698d2d868fde"
          ],
          "remediation": {
            "schema": "claim-remediation-projection/v1",
            "record": "remediation.json",
            "requires_revalidation": true,
            "claim_text_sha256": "892b997e859405ac45b31781e07ccaaaf977147fdd689099a8c8f067ff03caba"
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "If you copy snapshots to every region in a multi-region cluster, Atlas can perform faster direct attach restores instead of slower streaming restores after a regional outage. For faster cross-project restores, a multi-region target should be used only if copies of the snapshot exist in every region of that cluster, and a target configured with NVMe storage degrades restore performance. Snapshot distribution therefore does not guarantee a fixed restore time. Sources: https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/backup/cloud-backup/snapshot-distribution.md ; https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/backup/cloud-backup/restore-from-snapshot.md",
          "source": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/backup/cloud-backup/snapshot-distribution.md",
          "note": null,
          "claimId": "clm:a517123522b10b86ebb4c433c4ce263596d4fa2231470957a37fd15402fa7c25",
          "validationStatus": "REMEDIATED-PROJECTION",
          "evidenceIds": [],
          "also": [
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/backups/",
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/architecture/current/disaster-recovery.md",
            "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/backup/cloud-backup/restore-from-snapshot.md"
          ],
          "originValidationStatus": "SUPPORTED",
          "originEvidenceIds": [
            "ev:183350e795d0bcdb5a59fbea12547acaf8b0f710482213027aa342433f83a918",
            "ev:a7cf9347332532c2d5f2ab89bcab31db6188a7fceb87db0fcfc98c82e72b884f"
          ],
