            "https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/product-release-announcements/introducing-enhanced-control-for-cross-region-snapshots",
            "https://www.pointfive.co/efficiency-hub/inefficiencies/excessive-snapshot-retention-and-cross-region-copies-in-mongodb-atlas-cloud-backup"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A Reddit user describing an Atlas Flex cluster in me-central-1 said the live cluster and backups appeared inaccessible during a regional outage and asked whether a restore to another region could be forced. The thread verifies neither the backup configuration nor a restore outcome, so it is not evidence that configured cross-region copies failed. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-23)",
          "source": "https://www.reddit.com/r/mongodb/comments/1s9g9b9/mongodb_atlas_middle_east_outage_no_access_to/",
